+|----------|--------------|---------------------------|----------------|
+| HAPPY_PATH | juice scene, bird's-eye fit | casing rim + soft shadows + packet glints render, goldens re-blessed | n/a |
+| DEGENERATE | zero-length bundle | skip (existing len guard — casing must not draw on a zero-length band) | existing continue |
+| CASING WIDTH | band+casing wider than the congestion halo margin | halo still reads (halo width is band+5 — must clear the casing rim) | keep halo ≥ casing overhang |
+| PACKET GLINT | non-circle shapes (triangle/…, unknown classes) | glint only on circles (the fallback dot path) — shapes keep their current look | no glint on triangles |
